              <h3>Open and closed source code</h3>
<p>Please see the following video where you will learn more about open and closed source code.</p>

              <!-- sections.njk VIDEO! -->
              
              
              
      <div class="l-video-container">
        <video poster="~/images/svg/poster.svg" controls preload="metadata" aria-labelledby="watch" width="1000"
